  <item>
    <title>03：你来上海，我带你这样citywalk</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6631fd7f03bcdd73a901d2b9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6631fd7f03bcdd73a901d2b9</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 01 May 2024 08:29:49 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>citywalk对于上海来说算是绝配。这期《七分之一》来聊聊关于citywalk的理解，以及规划了几条路线，如果你来上海，可以这样走走逛逛，解锁上海的文化地标，打卡魔都网红景点，体会历史和现代的交融。借助我用</span><a href="https://www.expingworld.com/" data-url="https://www.expingworld.com/"><span>exping</span></a><span>规划出的路线，一起探寻城市之美，感受身边的烟火气和生活趣味。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="105">01:45</a> &nbsp;我对citywalk的理解：发现意外之美</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="258">04:18</a> &nbsp;在京都体会citywalk的真谛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="410">06:50</a> 上海适合citywalk的四个理由</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="640">10:40</a> 住上海交大附近是个明智选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a> &nbsp;探索上海西部</span></p><span></span><p><span>上生新所（茑屋书店、bluebottle、海军俱乐部泳池、孙科别墅）——定西路美食街（沪西老弄堂）——长宁来福士（圣玛利亚女校旧址）——中山公园——华东政法大学（圣约翰大学旧址、苏州河开放步道）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrG5vecTMNuQorSskgEvNHOwEZC0.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="950">15:50</a> 闲逛愚园路</span></p><span></span><p><span>20路百年公交车——堂屋糖水铺——愚园书室——长宁少年宫（红花楼）——Commune——愚园路公共市集——静安寺（apple旗舰店、静安公园）</span></p><span></span><p><span>参考：</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Dt411b7gR/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Dt411b7gR/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click"><span>纪录片《愚园路》</span></a></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgZ3dQTCG_TYDqmZHo_hsp-FLE2Z.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1328">22:08</a> 解锁梧桐区浪漫</span></p><span></span><p><span>武康路（武康大楼、巴金故居）——安福路（话梅、三顿半、多抓鱼、话剧中心）——复兴中路（交响乐团、黑石公寓）——淮海中路（上海音乐学院、国泰电影院、哈尔滨食品厂）——复兴公园</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Frv4NivPx8FuLZuEKC54h02ShyJ3.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1920">32:00</a> 童话之旅：迪士尼，解锁疯狂动物城，吐槽烟火秀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2270">37:50</a> 苏州河：从四行仓库到外滩</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi1v_7K7GqSnXZOsijf9fU90p1lv.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2460">41:00</a> 有上海，还有下海？</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fipp7JohyRsWsA1OhHQgIv1mcIoL.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2760">46:00</a> 适合中老年人的路线（AI提供）</span></p><span></span><p><span>外滩、豫园、陆家嘴……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2970">49:30</a> 松江之旅：登顶和寻根</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fica6b3XpANbfsGPsmBBcqfYt-DH.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3090">51:30</a> 上海有4个5A景区你知道是哪几个吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>配乐：片头由Suno生成，片尾</span><em><span>Take Me Home</span></em><span>, </span><em><span>Country Road</span></em><span>s</span></p><span></span><p><span>配图：徐家汇书院里的shanghai字样</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/luJ8FpRemvTyznIarYqiir1nqLVR.m4a" length="102984254" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:53:19</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj0n89k0PX43d1kr9xGBv2GIlgLs.png"/>
