  </item>
  <item>
    <title>02：清明追忆父亲 | 我想握住你的手&amp;送你一朵小红花</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/660da0cd4f66d1c1daef7184</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">660da0cd4f66d1c1daef7184</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 03 Apr 2024 18:32:44 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是一期特别私人的播客，清明追忆已离开十八年的父亲，那年高考没写的作文，那些从未说出的话，用七个片段融在这期播客里。就像我最后自己说的，我不仅想握住父亲的手，也想送他一朵小红花，感谢十七年的陪伴，父爱永存！</span></p><span></span><p><span>我一直不知道是用“父亲”还是“爸爸”的称谓，在播客里交叉出现，你可以认为说父亲时怀着一种敬意，而爸爸则是更随性的表达，本期播客回顾了父亲的过往、工作、爱好，父亲离世和高考作文题，父亲对我学习、对亲朋好友的点滴等等，总之我还是从他身上学到了很多，以下是本期一些shownotes，特别私人向：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 特别的开头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a> 做过知青的父亲，记忆点却是粉笔</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="310">05:10</a> 父亲工作的单位，如今成网红打卡点，也曾经拍过众多影视作品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="426">07:06</a> 略有闪光的门卫生涯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="500">08:20</a> 父亲的三大爱好，但我没一个继承下来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a> 父亲意外车祸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="827">13:47</a> 高考作文题《我想握住你的手》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="892">14:52</a> 父亲三次支持我学习上的选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1280">21:20</a> 我不爱吃蛋糕的真实原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1530">25:30</a> 父亲学好五笔，打字比我还快</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1660">27:40</a> 死亡不是生命终点，遗忘才是</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1800">30:00</a> 我和父亲的画面感，平淡但真实</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft_5f3ccGmxQKvT-supTztQcYHvr.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>👆一家三口唯一的合影</span></p><span></span><p><span>提及资料：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV19c411H7ao/?vd_source=99f67c68dd1bb7aecb2a956efc7781f1" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV19c411H7ao/?vd_source=99f67c68dd1bb7aecb2a956efc7781f1"><span>探寻上海科学会堂</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.iqiyi.com/v_19rr7r4vo0.html?iqiyi=o" data-url="https://www.iqiyi.com/v_19rr7r4vo0.html?iqiyi=o"><span>入殓师</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.iqiyi.com/v_19rr8cycvc.html?iqiyi=o" data-url="https://www.iqiyi.com/v_19rr8cycvc.html?iqiyi=o"><span>寻梦环游记</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.iqiyi.com/v_irqqpk2p6c.html?iqiyi=o" data-url="https://www.iqiyi.com/v_irqqpk2p6c.html?iqiyi=o"><span>送你一朵小红花</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>本期播客封面是一朵绽放的菊花，以寄哀思。播客每部分以响指声效间隔，呼应《漫长的季节》中那首诗歌，打个命运的响指吧，愿四季静好，气清景明~</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/loQQ2KIEJQzAnJzqN4koXCKHOyFm.m4a" length="30754559" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:31:41</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtUlQXvA-5M6s_Vll7CNMeqod4Pa.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>2</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>01：博物馆奇妙缘 | 三星堆 上博 南博 故宫 兵马俑</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65ffc4b62d9eae5d0aa95feb</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65ffc4b62d9eae5d0aa95feb</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 24 Mar 2024 06:14:13 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>逛博物馆已经成为一种生活方式的标配，这一期我想结合自己的博物馆体验聊聊对文博、国宝的认知。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>我与文博的渊源</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="61">01:01</a> 差点去浙大考古系的我</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="146">02:26</a> 大学参与</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/6432346/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/6432346/"><span>《夏鼐日记》</span></a><span>的出版</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>上海博物馆</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="410">06:50</a> 有点一言难尽的达芬奇展</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="534">08:54</a> 东馆开幕大展：三星堆翘臀小猛男走红</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="680">11:20</a> 上博镇馆之宝：大克鼎及其流转故事</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="813">13:33</a> 容易忽略的国宝：商鞅方升</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Frr2I06RlN6xRU_QNQwJj5lW4ja7.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>南京博物院</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="940">15:40</a> 逛不完的南博是什么来头</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1118">18:38</a> 我最看重的国宝：坤舆万国全图</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1492">24:52</a> 猜猜国宝西汉金兽到底是干嘛的？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv5HaCXuWSMdppJxpH_8HtyEiwor.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>四个故宫</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1670">27:50</a> 我最爱看故宫的一个地方</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1722">28:42</a> 沈阳故宫和北京故宫的差异</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1943">32:23</a> 台北故宫耳熟能详的国宝和文创</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2014">33:34</a> 香港故宫外围打卡</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2094">34:54</a> 避暑山庄也是故宫体系的一部分</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>地下文物看西安</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2295">38:15</a> 兵马俑原本的颜色很鲜艳</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2372">39:32</a> 铜车马很多机关无法复原</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2489">41:29</a> 陕西历史博物馆有哪些国宝</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnsGelhrAMs4q1hsVZyPvyQiNwII.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>推荐几个节目</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>《国家宝藏》、《何以中国》</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>想去的博物馆</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>湖南博物馆、湖北博物馆、殷墟、青州博物馆……</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>世界四大博物馆：大都会、大英、卢浮宫、冬宫</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>这是小思的个人播客《七分之一》，每期都会围绕一个主题去展开七个片段。本期的片头片尾音乐来自</span><a href="https://app.suno.ai/" data-url="https://app.suno.ai/"><span>suno</span></a><span>——一个AI音乐创作平台，本期的封面使用了AI生成，未来也会结合AI来提升体验和效果，希望你喜欢。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/loAOPDxPGKoYATnFmxnMgUBiv6qS.m4a" length="101350718" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:52:28</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZqUC1HRW5Na0tUTVhQaFVyOFp1UU5zNEFyWHgucG5n.png"/>
